@startuml SEQ_04_LOGOUT
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-04 · Logout\nAktor: Admin / Asisten / Kadep / Praktikan

actor       "Pengguna"                        as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"                         as Browser
control     "AuthenticatedSessionController"  as Controller

note over Controller
  Middleware: auth
  (hanya pengguna yang sudah login)
end note

== Logout ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Klik tombol Logout
Browser -> Controller  : POST /logout [middleware: auth]
Controller -> Controller : Auth::guard('web')->logout()
Controller -> Controller : $request->session()->invalidate()
note right of Controller
  Session lama dihancurkan total,
  semua data session dihapus
end note
Controller -> Controller : $request->session()->regenerateToken()
note right of Controller
  CSRF token diregenerasi
  untuk mencegah session fixation
end note
Controller --> Browser : redirect(route('login'))
Browser --> Pengguna   : Kembali ke halaman Login

@enduml
